      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WILLOW'S GIRL (1) was well in the market last time but only managed fourth (22.85), beaten 5.5 lengths. Was in the money the start prior. Tough to beat if on-song. PAW GAMMA (2) turned in a plain performance last time when sixth at this track over 390m behind I'm To Blame (22.80) in a Grade 5. Expected to feature in the finish. PAW LONDON (7) had been in super honest form hitting the frame two times on end before finishing sixth (22.82) at Ballarat last time. Solid record at the distance winning three races. In the mix. INGA AMY (8) is a last-start placegetter out of the same box - should be thereabouts.",
